{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名改裝愛好者mkopec通過修改固件，讓一款約40歐元、折合約45美元的Cable Matters 7合1 USB-C擴展塢支持Nintendo Switch 2電視輸出。普通USB-C擴展塢原本可以為主機充電，卻無法輸出畫面，因為Switch 2會先檢查底座是否能回應任天堂專有的通信握手。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586288.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.833324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:06:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"e6467a6333cc95af76f6b37dbbf9f25f7bec07f46ddfbc9d04374bb10d10f2de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}